@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

component "GardenNookWeb\nRazor + JS" as Web
component "GardenNookWpf\nWPF-клиент" as Wpf
component "GardenNookApi\nASP.NET Core Web API" as Api
component "TransferModels\nDTO-контракты" as Dto
database "MS SQL Server" as Db

Web --> Api : HTTPS / JSON
Wpf --> Api : HTTPS / JSON
Api --> Dto : использует DTO
Web --> Dto : использует DTO
Wpf --> Dto : использует DTO
Api --> Db : EF Core / SQL
@enduml
